"""2.6.74 stage C: build game/assets/pfboardv1.js (the v1 fight board script) as a FORK of game/assets/pfboard.js.
pfboard.js stays byte for byte as it is (the old board, pfight_v1 off). Every change is one exact replacement below; a replacement that no longer
applies stops the build, so a change to pfboard.js cannot silently drop a v1 feature. Run: python3 tools/build_pfboardv1.py  (writes the file; --check compares only)."""
import sys, os
R = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
